{"seq":2,"slug":"colbert-late-interaction","title":"ColBERT 与延迟交互","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reranking-retrieval-models/rerankers/colbert-late-interaction","wordCount":1436,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"colbert-与延迟交互\">ColBERT 与延迟交互</h1><p>双编码器太糙、交叉编码器太慢——有没有第三条路？ColBERT 给的答案是「延迟交互」（late interaction）：像双编码器那样把查询和文档分开编码、文档侧可离线预计算，但不把每篇文档压成一个向量，而是保留每个 token 一个向量；打分时不是算两个向量的点积，而是让查询的每个 token 去和文档所有 token 比、取最大，再求和。它把交互推迟到编码之后、但仍保留 token 级细粒度，正好卡在 <a href=\"../foundations/bi-vs-cross-encoder\">双编码器与交叉编码器</a> 连续谱的中间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-maxsim-延迟交互\">核心概念：MaxSim 延迟交互</h2><p>ColBERT 把查询编码成一组向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{q_1,\\dots,q_n\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>（每个查询 token 一个），文档编码成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{d_1,\\dots,d_m\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>（每个文档 token 一个）。相关性分数定义为：每个查询 token 找它在文档里最匹配的那个 token（取最大相似度），再把这些最大值加起来。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><munderover><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(q,d)=\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\max_{j=1}^{m} \\; q_i \\cdot d_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.032em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6306em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8638em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span></span> 操作就是 MaxSim，是延迟交互的灵魂。它意味着：查询里「重排」这个 token 只要在文档某处找到强匹配就贡献高分，不要求整篇文档向量和查询向量整体接近。这恢复了交叉编码器那种「逐词核对」的能力（<a href=\"../foundations/relevance-signals\">相关性信号</a> 里说的细粒度词项+语义匹配），却不需要把查询和文档拼起来联合编码。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Q[查询] --&gt; QE[编码器] --&gt; QV[查询 token 向量&lt;br/&gt;q1 q2 ... qn]&#10;  D[文档 离线编码] --&gt; DV[文档 token 向量&lt;br/&gt;d1 d2 ... dm 存入索引]&#10;  QV --&gt; MS[MaxSim&lt;br/&gt;每个 qi 取与所有 dj 的最大相似度]&#10;  DV --&gt; MS&#10;  MS --&gt; SUM[求和 → 相关分 s]\">flowchart TD\n  Q[查询] --&gt; QE[编码器] --&gt; QV[查询 token 向量&lt;br/&gt;q1 q2 ... qn]\n  D[文档 离线编码] --&gt; DV[文档 token 向量&lt;br/&gt;d1 d2 ... dm 存入索引]\n  QV --&gt; MS[MaxSim&lt;br/&gt;每个 qi 取与所有 dj 的最大相似度]\n  DV --&gt; MS\n  MS --&gt; SUM[求和 → 相关分 s]</pre><p>关键性质：文档侧的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{d_j\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 与查询无关，可以像双编码器一样离线算好、建索引。这让 ColBERT 既能当能扩展到大语料的检索器，也能当重排器，而交叉编码器只能当重排器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么它能兼顾精度与可扩展\">为什么它能兼顾精度与可扩展</h2><p>延迟交互的精度来自 token 级保真。双编码器的单向量瓶颈（<a href=\"../foundations/bi-vs-cross-encoder\">双编码器与交叉编码器</a> 里讲的表示瓶颈）在 ColBERT 这里被打破：一篇文档由几十上百个 token 向量表示，信息容量大得多，多约束查询的每个约束都能落到对应 token 上。同时，因为文档向量可预存，召回阶段能用近似最近邻在 token 向量上做检索，再用 MaxSim 精算，避免了交叉编码器全量在线前向的成本。</p>\n<p>代价是存储与检索复杂度。每篇文档存几十到上百个向量，索引体积比单向量双编码器大一两个数量级。ColBERTv2 用残差压缩缓解这点：每个 token 向量量化成「一个聚类中心 + 低精度残差」，把索引体积压缩约 6<del>10 倍（来源：colbertv2 论文与 huggingface colbert-ir/colbertv2.0）。检索效率则靠 PLAID 引擎：通过中心交互与剪枝，PLAID 相比原始 ColBERTv2 在 GPU 上降低延迟约 2.5</del>7 倍、CPU 上约 9~45 倍，同时保持检索质量（来源：PLAID 论文 arxiv 2205.09707）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>双编码器</th>\n<th>ColBERT 延迟交互</th>\n<th>交叉编码器</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文档表示</td>\n<td>1 向量</td>\n<td>每 token 1 向量</td>\n<td>不预存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询-文档交互</td>\n<td>单点积</td>\n<td>token 级 MaxSim</td>\n<td>全程联合注意力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文档可离线索引</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是（体积大）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索引体积</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>大（ColBERTv2 压 6~10×）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相对精度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可扩展到大语料</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>较强（PLAID 加速）</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"演进与多语扩展\">演进与多语扩展</h2><p>ColBERT 谱系到 2025 年已相当丰富。ColBERTv2 用残差压缩 + 去噪监督把质量和体积都改善了一截，是当前最常被引用的基线（colbert-ir/colbertv2.0）。Jina-ColBERT-v2 把延迟交互扩展到多语言，并支持动态输出维度（用更短的 token 向量换更小索引），适合多语场景。PLAID 作为配套检索引擎，把延迟交互从研究原型推向可生产部署。还有 ColBERT-Att 等变体把注意力机制引入延迟交互以进一步提质（arxiv 2603.25248）。</p>\n<p>实践中 ColBERT 既能独立做端到端检索器，也能当 <a href=\"../foundations/retrieve-then-rerank\">检索-重排两阶段</a> 里的中间一级——比纯向量召回准、比交叉编码器快，在候选集很大时尤其划算。它本质仍是 token 向量的相似度，所以训练方法（<a href=\"../training/hard-negatives-distillation\">难负样本与蒸馏</a>）与双编码器高度相通。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[ColBERT v1&lt;br/&gt;提出延迟交互 MaxSim] --&gt; B[ColBERTv2&lt;br/&gt;残差压缩 索引 6~10× 小]&#10;  B --&gt; C[PLAID 引擎&lt;br/&gt;中心剪枝 延迟 9~45× 低]&#10;  B --&gt; D[Jina-ColBERT-v2&lt;br/&gt;多语 + 动态维度]\">graph TD\n  A[ColBERT v1&lt;br/&gt;提出延迟交互 MaxSim] --&gt; B[ColBERTv2&lt;br/&gt;残差压缩 索引 6~10× 小]\n  B --&gt; C[PLAID 引擎&lt;br/&gt;中心剪枝 延迟 9~45× 低]\n  B --&gt; D[Jina-ColBERT-v2&lt;br/&gt;多语 + 动态维度]</pre><h2 id=\"何时选延迟交互\">何时选延迟交互</h2><p>延迟交互不是所有场景的最优解，它的甜区是「候选集大到交叉编码器跑不动、但又需要 token 级细粒度」。典型场景：超大语料的端到端检索、需要可解释逐 token 命中的检索、或作为级联中承上启下的一级。若候选已被收缩到几十条、追求绝对精度，<a href=\"cross-encoder-rerankers\">交叉编码器重排</a> 仍更准；若需遵循自然语言指令做复杂判断，<a href=\"llm-rerankers\">LLM 重排器</a> 上限更高。三者不是替代关系，而是延迟-精度-可扩展性三角上的不同点。延迟交互的额外存储成本是否值得，要算进 <a href=\"../practice/latency-cost-tradeoffs\">延迟与成本取舍</a> 的总账。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>延迟交互保留每 token 一个向量、文档侧可离线索引，用 MaxSim（每查询 token 取文档内最大相似度再求和）打分。</li>\n<li>它打破双编码器的单向量瓶颈，恢复 token 级细粒度匹配，同时保留可预计算与可扩展性。</li>\n<li>代价是索引体积大；ColBERTv2 残差压缩降 6<del>10 倍，PLAID 引擎降延迟 9</del>45 倍（CPU）使其可生产化。</li>\n<li>谱系：ColBERTv2 → PLAID（加速）/ Jina-ColBERT-v2（多语+动态维度）。</li>\n<li>甜区是「候选集大且需细粒度」；精度极限场景仍选交叉编码器，复杂指令场景选 LLM 重排。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../foundations/bi-vs-cross-encoder\">双编码器与交叉编码器</a> —— 延迟交互在架构连续谱上的位置。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"cross-encoder-rerankers\">交叉编码器重排</a> —— 精度极限场景的对照选择。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../training/hard-negatives-distillation\">难负样本与蒸馏</a> —— 延迟交互模型的训练。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../ai-search-retrieval/neural-retrieval/dense-retrieval\">稠密检索</a> —— 与延迟交互同源的稠密召回。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../rag-knowledge-systems/vector-databases/indexing-algorithms\">索引算法</a> —— token 向量索引依赖的 ANN 基础。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ColBERT 与延迟交互","id":"colbert-与延迟交互"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：MaxSim 延迟交互","id":"核心概念-maxsim-延迟交互"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么它能兼顾精度与可扩展","id":"为什么它能兼顾精度与可扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"演进与多语扩展","id":"演进与多语扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"何时选延迟交互","id":"何时选延迟交互"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"交叉编码器重排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reranking-retrieval-models/rerankers/cross-encoder-rerankers"},"next":{"title":"LLM 重排器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reranking-retrieval-models/rerankers/llm-rerankers"}}